    "description": "What: CE-5057 / CE-11063 A-4 (docs/DESIGN_Terrain_OSM_Bridges.md §6) — the synthetic terrain te-osm-bridge (its committed INPUT SET, imported on first use): a road along y 100 crosses a 6 m dip with a river in it (x 90-110). The crossing road edge carries OSM's bridge=yes, so the importer makes it ONE DECK from bank to bank (x 80-120) at the banks' height (10 m) — not the authored 1.5 m above the river. A TANK (from the west bank, ordered to the east bank) and a SQUAD (marching to the far bank, a ReachArea objective) cross on the deck. Judge: the tank reaches the east bank having never dropped toward the river bed over the river; the squad's objective ends Achieved."
